SUMMARY:Dream Outside the Box: Volunteering at MacGregor — Fossil Day
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:MacGregor
DESCRIPTION:Today's theme is paleontology: each table gets a bag of half-mi
 xed salt dough that kids finish squishing\, then every kid presses toy din
 osaurs\, shells and leaves into their own plate to make a fossil. Run of s
 how: 3:15 welcome/table talk\, 3:25 mix dough\, 3:35 make fossils\, 4:00 f
 ossil guess and clean up. Volunteers should write names on plates first\, 
 keep dough about half an inch thick\, and help the younger kids lift the d
 inos straight up for clean prints.\nHost: Dream Outside the Box\nRSVP requ
 ested by Sun Oct 18\, 11:59 PM: https://forms.gle/RifERGbF234ZPKCc8\nDetai
 ls: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/event/202.html
URL:https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/event/202.html
CATEGORIES:Service / volunteering
